# Reference PDFs kept locally only — do not redistribute from a public repo
lit/*.pdf

# results/ is deliberately NOT ignored. The raw per-image detector scores are
# 21MB total and they are the evidence behind every number in the paper - the
# repository's own rule is that no number enters the paper unless code here
# produced it, which is unverifiable if the scores live only on an ephemeral
# disk. A container restart during this work made that risk concrete.
# data/ stays ignored: 60k PNGs is corpus, regenerable via
# scripts/materialize_split.py.
